Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:09.50,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Daeva Azhdaha... Otash!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:16.24,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.75,0:00:18.43,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I guess I just can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:22.41,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,Stop wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:23.78,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,Hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.78,0:00:24.71,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Give that back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:27.62,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,This is more suited for me than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:30.59,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,I'm sure His Majesty will \Ntell you the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:31.38,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:34.63,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,Daeva Azhdaha... Otash!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:36.52,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:38.95,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,See ya, Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.79,0:00:46.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Curse you... Akoman!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:22.49,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE DEMON KING'S ATTENDANT IS TOO DEPRESSED!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:22.49,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Demon King's Attendant \NIs Too Depressed!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.77,0:02:37.32,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:39.63,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.04,0:02:40.89,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.89,0:02:42.55,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.86,0:02:45.19,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That's a very pretty gem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:51.61,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I was picking up rocks so no one would \Ntrip on them, and I found this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:52.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.25,0:02:55.73,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It's going to be Doux's treasure forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.13,0:02:58.86,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Treasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.57,0:03:06.33,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,A treasure... A treasure-re-re-re-re...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.57,0:03:08.98,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Big Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:15.25,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Something very important \Nwas taken from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:17.59,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Something very important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.94,0:03:23.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes. It's a powerful weapon called an \NOoparts left behind by ancient demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.33,0:03:26.52,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,And when I had been promoted \Nto His Majesty's attendant...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:30.59,flashback,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You are worthy of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:33.47,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,He gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.73,0:03:38.61,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,But that fool Akoman stole it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:42.54,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I've tried to take it back, but he \Njust keeps getting away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.15,0:03:46.49,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,He left me no choice but to report \Nwhat happened to the demon king and...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.86,0:03:51.48,flashback,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What a flashy lad \Noverflowing with ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:53.65,flashback,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,He's a true demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.65,0:03:55.89,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,He ended up praising him instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.75,0:03:59.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.42,0:04:04.34,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.76,0:04:06.76,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux's gonna steal it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.58,0:04:08.20,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:11.18,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!\NThat's not necessary, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.18,0:04:14.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What could you possibly gain from \Ndoing such a thing, Lady Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:17.90,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Well, you told me before...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.43,0:04:19.44,flashback,JAHI,0,0,0,,Please listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.67,0:04:24.05,flashback,JAHI,0,0,0,,Demons steal, oppress, and kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.05,0:04:26.32,flashback,JAHI,0,0,0,,Those are the three \Nprinciples we live by!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.63,0:04:30.36,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,That's why I'm gonna steal \Nyour important thing back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.36,0:04:31.58,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.01,0:04:33.86,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,L-Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.98,0:04:49.54,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Apparently, Akoman is still \Nasleep. Now is our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:51.15,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup, chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.85,0:04:58.43,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's bad at cleaning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.43,0:05:02.39,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,And he's a high-ranking official of \Nthe demon king's army... How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:06.61,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I can't seem to find the Ooparts anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:10.95,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister, what's this \NOopaoopa look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.78,0:05:16.71,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}Ooparts{\i0}. It's a large staff, \Nso if he were to hide it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.11,0:05:19.08,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It'd probably be under his bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:21.15,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,All right, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.15,0:05:25.97,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Will you sneak into his room and retrieve \Nthe Ooparts for me without being seen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:27.49,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup! I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.49,0:05:28.64,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:29.78,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:32.90,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You must do this quietly, \Nso he doesn't wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:38.85,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I ended up involving Lady \NDoux in a personal matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.85,0:05:40.02,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Umph.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:45.41,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,But Lady Doux is serious for once.\N I cannot ignore her offer...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.37,0:05:48.49,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:56.34,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Akoman is an expert at \Nsensing evil or malice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:18.39,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,He'd notice me instantly \Nif I were to enter the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:21.35,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,But Lady Doux possesses no evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:24.15,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I don't know anyone more fitting for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.55,0:06:26.94,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Pardon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:29.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Lady Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:33.10,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Well, you're supposed to knock before \Ngoing into someone's room, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:35.97,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes, but you're not supposed \Nto be found right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.97,0:06:37.73,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,so you don't need to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.73,0:06:39.42,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:41.39,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's just like hide-and-seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:44.96,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You must move quickly and quietly \Nso you don't get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:46.15,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:52.80,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Quickly... quietly... \Nso I don't get caught?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.97,0:06:55.38,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:02.52,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Y-You're all right, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.52,0:07:04.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It doesn't hurt. It doesn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:08.59,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It doesn't hurt. It doesn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:16.98,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,He's still asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.62,0:07:20.99,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Okay, third time's the charm, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.37,0:07:22.33,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:25.50,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Quickly... Quietly...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.09,0:07:29.01,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Quickly... Quietly...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.79,0:07:30.84,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Umph.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:32.47,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.47,0:07:35.72,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Quickly... Quietly...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:37.10,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Umph.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.10,0:07:39.48,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You don't need to keep saying "Umph."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:42.37,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Quickly... Quietly...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.73,0:07:45.88,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux! By your feet! Your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:48.02,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.35,0:07:52.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.91,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Look, Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:08:00.50,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux is in a circus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.50,0:08:03.72,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux! Shh! You need to shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.81,0:08:10.51,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,This isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.85,0:08:13.81,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux has completely \Nentered play mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.83,0:08:18.01,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.23,0:08:23.29,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Umph.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:25.10,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:38.74,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:49.21,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.83,0:08:51.30,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:57.62,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,He hasn't noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:08:59.59,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, now's your chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.59,0:09:01.71,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Please search under his bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:02.67,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.10,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:11.71,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.71,0:09:14.98,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I didn't find the staff, but \NI found some oohlalapants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:18.45,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Why are you bringing \Nsomething like that over?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.77,0:09:20.78,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It's smaller than Papa's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.10,0:09:23.32,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I definitely didn't need to know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.07,0:09:29.46,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you sneaking around for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:33.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,A-Akoman! Th-This is just, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.12,0:09:37.98,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister wanted oohlalapants, \Nso Doux came to steal them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.98,0:09:38.97,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:42.72,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,You wanted my underwear so \Nbadly you had a kid steal them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:44.73,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,What a perv.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:48.20,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No one wants your underwear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:50.98,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I came to steal the Oopar... oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.89,0:09:55.49,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,I figured you were after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:09:59.86,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,There's no point in you having it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:03.99,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,You can only use Ooparts when \Nyou're over 500 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.62,0:10:10.12,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,How long do you think this thing will \Nbe rotting away before you can use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:14.00,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,That's why I'm saying that \NI'll make actual use of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:15.83,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,Just give it up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:16.51,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.34,0:10:22.55,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Oohlalapants.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.53,0:10:33.15,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I knew that... but His \NMajesty gave it to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:34.76,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,So I can't give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.59,0:10:39.66,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:42.41,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:43.55,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:45.76,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.76,0:10:50.30,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,B-But Lady Doux, this is \Nyour precious treasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:51.51,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.19,0:10:57.42,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But I want you to cheer up \Neven a little, Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:11:00.93,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux... But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.93,0:11:01.86,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:06.17,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Where did you get that gem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.17,0:11:07.49,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Y-Your Majesty?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.49,0:11:08.36,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:12.81,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Jahi! To think I'd find this \Ngem while looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.81,0:11:15.07,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:19.11,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Well, the incident with the \NOoparts had been on my mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.11,0:11:20.32,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:21.05,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.81,0:11:26.86,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I apparently caused you some anxiety \Nbecause I gave it to you so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:29.20,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:32.38,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,So I wanted to make you \Nanother weapon instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.38,0:11:34.81,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,and I was looking for a magic stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:37.25,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,And it's right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.25,0:11:38.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is a magic stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:40.34,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:44.54,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'll be able to make \Nsomething quite powerful with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.54,0:11:46.10,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,P-Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:49.02,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That gem is Lady Doux's treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.02,0:11:53.27,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,If you're going to do something with it, \Nit should at least belong to Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:55.66,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Is that right, Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:11:59.15,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Nope. I already gave it to Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.15,0:12:01.35,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I can't possibly take \Nsomething so important!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.35,0:12:03.86,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But I want you to cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:05.67,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.67,0:12:07.45,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Even without the oohlalapants?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.45,0:12:08.20,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Oohlalapants?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:09.53,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,She means the Ooparts!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.53,0:12:11.41,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.07,0:12:14.67,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What Akoman said is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.07,0:12:17.33,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I can't use it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.33,0:12:21.55,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But I want you to have \Nthis, Big Sister Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.79,0:12:24.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:25.69,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:29.59,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Then it can be both of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:33.77,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,This treasure can belong to both of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.21,0:12:37.07,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.11,0:12:41.46,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I can't wait to get to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:43.66,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What kind of special \Neffect should I give it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:48.49,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,There's catastrophe, dimensional \Nconfinement, and even stopping time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.49,0:12:50.72,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,N-No, I don't think I need any of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:53.78,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux wants one that'll \Ngive me lots of snacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.78,0:12:54.79,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Snacks, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.93,0:12:56.73,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE NEXT DAY
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.66,0:12:58.82,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:06.60,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, this is overdoing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.11,0:13:12.47,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE DEMON KING'S ATTENDANT IS TOO TIRED!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.04,0:13:12.47,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Demon King's Attendant \NIs Too Tired!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.73,0:13:13.50,Default,SUBORDINATE A,0,0,0,,Lady Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.50,0:13:14.18,Default,SUBORDINATE B,0,0,0,,Lady Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:14.94,Default,SUBORDINATE C,0,0,0,,Lady Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.17,0:13:16.89,Default,SUBORDINATE A,0,0,0,,There's a misprint in this magical tome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.89,0:13:18.50,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.50,0:13:20.95,Default,SUBORDINATE B,0,0,0,,Please help us collect \Nresources to make weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:22.76,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'll adjust my schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.76,0:13:24.19,Default,SUBORDINATE C,0,0,0,,Please train me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:25.70,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:27.33,Default,SUBORDINATE D,0,0,0,,Please sign this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.33,0:13:28.57,Default,SUBORDINATE E,0,0,0,,Please give us a budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.57,0:13:31.03,Default,COOK DEMON,0,0,0,,We don't have enough salt! Oh, the salt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.65,0:13:36.37,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Th-This isn't good... It's time to \Ngo with Lady Doux on her trial...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.37,0:13:40.49,Default,SUBORDINATES,0,0,0,,Lady Jahi! Lady Jahi! Lady Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:43.88,Default,SUBORDINATES,0,0,0,,Lady Jahi! Lady Jahi! Lady Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.89,0:13:56.41,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is my...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.27,0:13:58.14,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,room?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:14:00.11,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.11,0:14:01.27,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:03.78,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Is your fever gone now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.01,0:14:04.76,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.38,0:14:11.03,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You passed out because you had a fever, \Nso Papa carried you all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:13.29,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:17.15,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Have you been taking \Ncare of me, Lady Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.15,0:14:21.77,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup! Me and Papa\N just made you dinner, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:23.80,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,He'll bring it soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:25.59,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.71,0:14:28.80,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I was asleep for over half the day?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:30.89,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.37,0:14:34.01,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,But I can't cause anyone any more trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.01,0:14:35.72,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I have to get back to work...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.72,0:14:37.21,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.81,0:14:40.44,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux?! Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:42.69,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You have to beddy-bye properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:48.51,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,That's your trial, Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:49.70,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,T-Trial?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:53.45,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,A trial to rest until you get all better!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.45,0:14:54.69,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.69,0:14:57.80,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa even said it was a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.11,0:15:00.79,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,V-Very well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.41,0:15:05.59,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Today, Doux is in charge \Nof taking care of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.91,0:15:12.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I completely fail as an attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:12.68,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:13.97,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Oh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:19.59,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,L-Lady Doux, did you \Nproperly wring this out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.59,0:15:22.48,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup. I squeezed it really tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.35,0:15:27.87,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,But Lady Doux is physically weak...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.95,0:15:31.48,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Er, that's not even the \Nfirst problem at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.51,0:15:31.86,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,DIRTY RAG
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:36.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, I have some \Ntowels in my closet...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.03,0:15:38.89,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'll go get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:42.75,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:46.06,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes. Oh, if you can't reach, I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:49.51,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It's okay! See? It opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:51.14,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:55.90,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I-I'm so terribly sorry! I've been so \Nbusy with work that I hadn't cleaned it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.22,0:15:59.56,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux will clean it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.86,0:16:02.64,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Cleaning complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.77,0:16:05.05,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,A picture book!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.05,0:16:09.78,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a book I used \Nto read when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.78,0:16:11.72,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux will read it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:13.89,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm sure she just wants \Nto read it for herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.31,0:16:17.03,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,If you would, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.53,0:16:19.54,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:23.16,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Once upon a... Zzz...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:24.84,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,She instantly fell asleep?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:26.67,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,H-Hello, Lady Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:30.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You mustn't sleep here! \NYou'll catch a cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.14,0:16:33.91,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.91,0:16:36.18,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Are you awake now, Jahi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.93,0:16:39.01,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Y-Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:40.67,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It's Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.67,0:16:42.36,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Time for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.41,0:16:52.51,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You got a fever from extreme overwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.51,0:16:53.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:57.53,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,If it were something like a cold, \NDoux would've healed you by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:16:59.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:03.79,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,But the only way to cure \Noverwork is to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:07.92,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,That's why Doux stayed by your side \Nthis whole time to take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.38,0:17:10.28,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.62,0:17:11.67,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.93,0:17:13.30,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:20.01,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:23.89,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Eat lots and get better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.12,0:17:26.69,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,GURGLE GURGLE
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:37.45,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Here, you should have some, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.29,0:17:43.70,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.14,0:17:47.21,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:50.62,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I don't know how I can thank \Nyou enough, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:54.85,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I'm the one who should be thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.85,0:17:55.59,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:18:00.36,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Well... You see, I tried to \Ndo your work in your stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:01.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.45,0:18:04.85,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,And boy, was it a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.85,0:18:07.73,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,That was more work than one \Nshould do on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:11.69,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,It definitely hit me that we had \Ngiven you too much work because
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:13.14,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,we trust you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.73,0:18:21.08,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,So, Jahi, I have redistributed some\Nof your duties to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.26,0:18:26.30,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Even then, I might still have \Nto give you a lot more work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:30.68,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,And if it becomes too much for you,\NI'll find a substitute for Doux's trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:34.10,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I've discussed the matter\Nwith Doux as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:38.68,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You just rest and think \Nthis over carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:44.90,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.90,0:18:47.56,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux can wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:48.56,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:52.61,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux will do her best \Neven if you're gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.31,0:18:58.44,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But if that happens, can I come \Nsee you every now and then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.87,0:19:01.20,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.46,0:19:02.78,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.45,0:19:06.20,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay, you can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.45,0:19:06.20,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,SHOULDER MASSOOGE TICKET
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.70,0:19:07.59,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.59,0:19:10.08,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,If you get tired again, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.08,0:19:12.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux will tap, tap your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:18.53,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.37,0:19:53.88,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,SHOULDER MASSOOGE TICKET
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.17,0:19:52.68,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,She spelled it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:20:01.63,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, it's time for today's trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.63,0:20:05.62,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Jahi? What are {\i1}you{\i0} doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.62,0:20:07.69,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Is your fever all better?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.69,0:20:10.68,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm surprised myself \Nat how much better I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:11.89,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.89,0:20:15.47,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,E-Even if you feel better, \Nyou're still recovering.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.47,0:20:17.50,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You can't work like tha...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:20.22,Default,DEMONS,0,0,0,,Lady Jahi, thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:22.53,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,As you can see, I finished \Neverything already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.53,0:20:23.78,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.78,0:20:27.07,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Th-That's not good, Jahi!\N If you push yourself like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.07,0:20:29.54,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's all right, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.55,0:20:29.54,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,SHOULDER MASSOOGE TICKET
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.41,0:20:35.42,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,SHOULDER MASSOOGE TICKET
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.69,0:20:35.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The next time I get tired, I'll have \NLady Doux give me a shoulder massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.75,0:20:39.41,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.67,0:20:44.93,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm still going to be \Nstern with you, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.93,0:20:47.18,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay, got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.08,0:20:54.94,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux! You don't have a shoulder \Nmassage ticket for me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.13,0:22:28.13,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,DOUX'S SHOULDER MASSOOGE PARLOR
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.38,0:22:31.39,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,"SHOULDER MASSOOGER"\NLYRICS: KANATA NAKAMURA\N COMPOSITION AND ARRANGEMENT: TAKERU TAKEMIYA\NSONG: DOUX
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:36.68,italicstop,DOUX,0,0,0,,Welcome
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.89,0:22:38.93,italicstop,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.14,0:22:43.02,italicstop,DOUX,0,0,0,,Take a load off
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.77,0:22:52.28,italicstop,DOUX,0,0,0,,We'll get rid of your everyday fatigue
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.82,0:23:01.33,italicstop,DOUX,0,0,0,,When we get rid of your everyday fatigue
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.03,0:23:10.47,italicstop,DOUX,0,0,0,,Let's play lots and lots again
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.11,0:23:15.39,italicstop,DOUX,0,0,0,,Tap tap tap, tap tap tap
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.76,0:23:19.64,italicstop,DOUX,0,0,0,,Tap tap tap, tappity tap
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.14,0:23:24.65,italicstop,DOUX,0,0,0,,Tap tap tap, tap tap tap
